Shortest Path (https://github.com/Skretzo/shortest-path) by Skretzo
Farm Run Optimizer does not include Shortest Path's code. When both plugins are installed, it sends
Shortest Path the location of the next stop (through RuneLite's plugin messages) so it can draw the walking line.
